#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Website:
 *  - the account menu also stays on Support (and a ticket) and on Report a bug, with Contact us marked (they are reached from it);
 *  - Support, a ticket's conversation and My returns are in the visitor's language (Arabic was English): the titles, the buttons, the form, the statuses;
 *    Support shows how many tickets there are, how many are open and resolved, and a resolved ticket asks "Was this resolution helpful?" (once);
 *  - Report a bug: the screenshot button says "Choose a file" / "No file chosen" in the site's language (the browser's own said it in English).
 * Needs patch-account-headers first.
 *
 *   node scripts/patch-support-arabic.js            dry run
 *   node scripts/patch-support-arabic.js --write    applies it (each changed file is saved as <file>.before-support-arabic first)
 */
